	<!--Example of the strings xml format for their text-->
	<!-- Seanchan -->
	<string id="prebackstory.wanderer_seanchan_0" text="You look like an adventurous person, let us talk." />
	<string id="backstory_a.wanderer_seanchan_0" text="For us Seanchan who are not born of the blood, we are expected to give our blood.  Our only worth is to try and achieve recognition in their eyes and be promoted to the blood.  But at what cost to those we love and respect? " />
	<string id="backstory_b.wanderer_seanchan_0" text="Instead of pursuing the Seanchan dream, I have chosen to see all the world, from Seanchan to Shara and all that is between.  I have travelled the length and breadth of all Seanchan.  " />
	<string id="backstory_c.wanderer_seanchan_0" text="So now here I am, sitting in this tavern, considering life, enjoying an ale, good food and listening to the locals tell their tales while contemplating my next adventure!" />
	<string id="response_1.wanderer_seanchan_0" text="If it's adventure you want, there is plenty on offer in times such as these." />
	<string id="response_2.wanderer_seanchan_0" text="Is it really adventure you want, or is ambition your true motive?" />
	<string id="backstory_d.wanderer_seanchan_0" text="If you are offering a chance for me to see the world, you will find no better hand than my own." />
	<string id="generic_backstory.wanderer_seanchan_0" text="I am determined to see all the world, from Seachan to Shara and all that is between!" />
	<!--You need the complete set for the converstaion path with the first poart of the id as the story phase and the second part after the . is the wanderer name-->